		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>A skeletal ogre with a horse's skull for a head. Surrounded by the stench of rot and a cloud of black, bloated flies.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 25, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 claw +4 (1d6) or 1 longbow +2 (1d8 + blind curse) or cloud of flies, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 5</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Blind Curse</strong>. WIS 15+ or cursed with blindness.</p><p></p><p><strong>Cloud of Flies</strong>. Breathe out a cloud of biting flies that fills a near-sized cube extending from daemon. All mortals, CON 15+ on turn or 1d8 damage. Flies stay for 3 rounds.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
